  "_doc": "The pit's fattest toad, fed on raw sulphur by the Slagborn gangs. P1 \"Feeding\": a sticky tongue that drags the farthest player in, yellow spit, and a belch cone. P2 at 50% \"Swelled\": it puffs up with gas — every so often it lets the gas go in a huge cloud around itself (get out), and the gas lingers in patches that weaken.",
